# browser.xcl - drive a Chromium browser with the plain XCL browser verbs.
#
# No plugin needed for these verbs - they are built into the language and the
# run's browser is launched for you:
#
#   xcelerate --browser brave run browser.xcl
#
# (The `browser` library is the plugin-shaped equivalent: it exposes
# the same work as ops, e.g. `run browser open {"url":"..."}`.)

import browser
open "https://example.com"
assert url contains example.com

done
